   "max_lines": 1,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "ギガノス軍基地攻略",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#5",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "tokens": [],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 1,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "輸送部隊追撃",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#6",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<ac(1)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><ac(1)>見たところ、ずいぶん新顔も増えたようだな。\n私が本艦の艦長、エイパー・シナプスだ。\n以後、よろしく頼む。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#7",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(1)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>さて、これより本艦<im(1)>の航路、及び\n作戦行動について説明する。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#8",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>ガンダムを強奪した#c[BE5050]ジオン残党#c勢力は、\n北上したところで哨戒機に発見されている。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#9",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>その後の針路や推進剤残量、\nそして、彼らと#c[BE5050]ギガノス#c軍が協力関係に\nあることなどから考えて、",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#10",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>目的地<im(2)>は発見地点の付近にある\n#c[BE5050]ギガノス#c軍基地に間違いないと判断した。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#11",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>#c[BE5050]統一帝国ギガノス#cは月を拠点とする\n軍事政権だが、近年、地球への侵攻行動も\n本格化している。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#12",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(7)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>そして現在、地上各地の拠点に\n居座っているのは、<im(7)>諸君も知ってのとおりだ。\nこの基地も、その一つだな。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#13",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[5E8FD8]",
    "#c",
    "<im(9)>",
    "<im(6)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>我々は、当作戦区域に展開中の\n#c[5E8FD8]ＵＣＥメタルアーマー部隊#cと<im(9)><im(6)>合流し、\n#c[F07141]ガンダム奪還作戦#cを行う。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#14",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<of(1)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>なお、負傷したバニング大尉を補佐する\n小隊長代理が配属されることになった。<of(1)>\n作戦中に合流する手はずになっている。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63001#15",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>説明は以上だ。\n全員、作戦開始まで少し休んでおけ。\nこれから忙しくなるぞ。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
