    "#c",
    "<tr(1)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>今回<im(1)>の作戦の最初の目標となるのは、\n#c[BE5050]ギガノス#c軍前線基地です。<tr(1)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63033#5",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 56,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(56,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>#c[BE5050]ガンダム２号機#cは、基地施設周辺に\n格納された可能性があるという報告が\n入っているため、制圧作戦を行います。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63033#6",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 56,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(56,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "<im(4)>",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>#c[F07141]基地施設を<im(4)>全て破壊#cして、基地の機能を\n停止させてください。",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
